    "body": "Source: SOCIAL SCIENCE REVIEWER A.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nC. Liu Bang\nD. Laozi\n31. Who were military leaders with their own armies?\nA. Governor\nB. Bureaucrat\nC. Warlords\nD. Administrator\n32. President who proclaimed Sultan Kudarat, a Maguindanao sultan, a national hero of the\nPhilippines\nA. Ferdinand Marcos\nB. Manuel Quezon.\nC. Joseph Estrada\nD. Fidel Ramos\n33. First President to take his oath in Pilipino\nA. Carlos P Garcia\nB. Ramon Magsaysay\nC. Manuel L Quezon\nD. Ferdinand Marcos\n34. Name given to the \"New Republic\" of 1981\nA. First Republic\nB. Second Republic\nC. Third Republic\nD. Fourth republic\n35. Who are the head of the Chinese family?\nA. The Oldest Man\nB. The Father\nC. The Oldest Woman\nD. The Smartest Person\n36. What is the meaning of NPA, as the military arm of the communist Party of the Philippines?\nA. National Policy Association\nB. New People's Army\nC. No Permanent Address\nD. Non-Performing Assets\n37. Wu Wang lead a rebellion against this dynasty because they were cruel\nA. The Han Dynasty\nB. The Daoism Dynasty\nC. The Shihuangdi Dynasty\nD. The Shang Dynasty\n38. A system of appointed officials that run different parts of the government.\nA. Bureaucracy\nB. Civil Service\nC. Officialdom\nD. A Union\n39. _________ promotes a peaceful society\nA. Taoism\nB. Dao De Jing\nC. Zhuangzi\nD. Daoism\n40. A formal order is ____________.\nA. Directive\nB. Consent\nC. Mandate\nD. Tenure\n41. A practice that requires children to respect their parents and older relatives.\nA. Permissible\nB. Filial Piety\nC. Hanfeizi\nD. Bureaucrat\n42. New system of provincial and town councils created by President Marcos in\n1975\n\nA. Kilusang Kabuhayan at Kaunlaran\nB. New Society\nC. Sanggunianng Bayan\nD. Batasang Pambansa\n43. The alleged assassin of Ninoy Aquino\nA. Rolando Galman\nB. Danding Cojuangco Jr.\nC. Gen. Fabian Ver\nD. Ferdinand Marcos\n44. A character that stands for an object\nA. Hieroglyph\nB. Reflection\nC. Diagram\nD. Pictograph\n45. Among the problems confronting the Aquino administration was the threat from the MNLF in\nMindanao. What is the meaning of MNLF.\nA. Moro National Liberation Fighter\nB. Moro National Liberation Front\nC. Moro National Liberation Foundation\nD. Moro National Liberation Freedom\n46. An idea formed from 2 or more pictographs joined together.\nA. Isography\nB. Ideography\nC. Geography\nD. Orthography\n47. Which is considered as the most ancient part of the world by historians?\nA. Gangetic Valley\nB. Southern part of Vindhya Mountain\nC. North Western Indian Valley\nD. North Eastern part of India\n48. The TV station and media installations that were blocked by the rebel soldiers\nA. Channel 2\nB. Channel 5\nC. Channel 7\nD. Channel 9\n49. The name \"Archipelago of San Lazarus\" was given to the Philippines by\nA. Ruy López de Villalobos\nB. Ferdiand Magellan\nC. Miguel López de Legazpi\nD. Antonio Pigafetta\n50. The actual site in Maragondon, Cavite where the Bonifacio brother, Andres & Procopio, were\nexecuted\nA. Mt. Hulog\nB. Mt. Halcon\nC. Mt. Montalban\nD. Mt Isarog",
