    "body": "Source: SOCIAL SCIENCE REVIEWER C.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nC. Federal Party\nD. Liberal Party\n47. What is the pseudonym used by Pablo Faced?\nA. Hermano Pule\nB. Quioquiap\nC. Laong Laan\nD. Plaridel\n48. Who was called \"The First Filipino Diplomat\"?\nA. Felipe Agoncillo\nB. Robert Cortez\nC. Felipe Calderon\nD. Miguel Cuaderno\n49. Who was the leader of the Cavite Mutiny, the first huelga (labor strike) recorded in the\nPhilippines?\nA. Patricio Montojo\nB. Rafael de Izquerdo\nC. Francisco la Madrid\nD. Macliing Dulag\n50. The first president of the Katipunan.\nA. Juan Arellano\nB. Andres Bonifacio\nC. Teodoro Agoncillo\nD. Deodato Arellano",
