    "body": "Source: SOCIAL SCIENCE REVIEWER I.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nA. Andes\nB. Kunlun\nC. Himalayas\nD. Karakoram\nWhat religious group suffered heavily in Europe during the Nazi Holocaust?\nA. Atheist\nB. Jewish\nC. Buddhist\nD. Christian\nMost of the people in Latin America during the colonial period came from what known\nplace in the world?\nA. Amazon Rainforest\nB. Andes Mountain\nC. Scandinavian\nD. Iberian Peninsula\nIt is considered as one of the worst eruptions of the century that almost affects the\nearth’s atmosphere due to its ash falls\nA. Mt. Hibuk-Hibok\nB. Mt. Pinatubo\nC. Mt. Kanlaon\nD. Mt. Mayon\nWhich part of the earth where we can experience six (6) months of continuous daylight\nand six (6) months continuous darkness each year?\nA. Greenland\nB. North Pole\nC. Greenwich, England\nD. Iceland\nIn what part of the world can you approximately find the International Date Line (IDL)?\nA. Atlantic Ocean\nB. Pacific Ocean\nC. Greenwich, England\nD. North Pole\nIn what part of the world can you find the longest and largest coral reef which is also\nknown as the “Great Barrier Reef”?\nA. Africa\nB. Australia\nC. South America\nD. Europe\nIt is a common knowledge that all bodies of water are interconnected with one another\nbut this ocean covers 1/3 of the world from Arctic to Antarctica\nA. Arctic Ocean\nB. Pacific Ocean\nC. Indian Ocean\nD. North Atlantic Ocean\nWhich of the following countries is not part of the Association of the South East Asian\nNations (ASEAN)?\nA. Malaysia\nB. Taiwan\nC. Philippines\nD. Singapore\nAmong the South American nations, this country is the only Portuguese speaking\ncountry\nA. Argentina\nB. Brazil\nC. Peru\nD. Chile\nThe first African nation that tried to establish industrialization to lessen the worsening\nunemployment rate of the country\nA. Botswana\n\n3 | LET REVIEWER UNIVERSITY\n\n28.\n\n29.\n\n30.\n\nB. South Africa\nC. Egypt\nD. Kenya\nIt is known to the ancient and modern world that this is the home of rich and key cities\nof the world. It is also of the major tourist destination and it provides a well-designed\nairports and railways across the continent\nA. Africa\nB. Europe\nC. Asia\nD. Australia\nThe opening of the Suez Canal connects the trading route between these two bodies of\nwater\nA. Atlantic Ocean and Pacific Ocean\nB. Mediterranean Sea and Red Sea\nC. Caribbean Sea and Gulf of Mexico\nD. Indian Ocean and Bay of Bengal\nThis is the known Peninsula in Europe that occupied by Norway, Sweden, Denmark also\nincluded is Iceland and Finland\nA. Apennines\nB. Balkan\nC. Scandinavian\nD. Iberian\n\n4 | LET REVIEWER UNIVERSITY",
