    "body": "Source: SOCIAL SCIENCE (5).pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nAnswer Keys:\n1. c\n2. d\n3. c\n4. b\n5. a\n6. c\n7. c\n8. c\n9. a\n10. d\n11. c\n12. d\n13. b\n14. b\n15. c\n16. c\n17. a\n18. d\n19. c\n20. b\n21. d\n22. c\n23. c\n24. b\n25. a\n26. b\n27. b\n28. c\n29. b\n30. a\n31. d\n32. c\n33. d\n34. b\n35. d\n36. c\n37. c\n38. a\n39. b\n40. d\n41. c\n\n42. a\n43. b\n44. c\n45. c\n46. b\n47. c\n48. a\n49. d\n50. a\n51. c\n52. a\n53. b\n54. a\n55. c\n56. d\n57. a\n58. c\n59. b\n60. a\n61. d\n62. b\n63. c\n64. c\n65. b\n66. c\n67. c\n68. d\n69. c\n70. a\n71. d\n72. c\n73. a\n74. b\n75. a\n76. c\n77. c\n78. b\n79. c\n80. b\n81. a\n82. b\n83. d\n\n84. c\n85. b\n86. a\n87. b\n88. c\n89. d\n90. b\n91. b\n92. a\n93. d\n94. c\n95. a\n96. b\n97. b\n98. c\n99. d\n100.\n101.\n102.\n103.\n104.\n105.\n106.\n107.\n108.\n109.\n110.\n111.\n112.\n113.\n114.\n115.\n116.\n117.\n118.\n119.\n120.\n\na\nc\nb\nd\nb\na\nd\nb\nc\nc\nc\nb\na\nc\nc\nc\na\nb\nc\na\nb",
