    "source_path": "/Users/lyndon/All reviewers/-LET REVIEWER 2026/C. MAJOR SUBJECTS/F. SOCIAL SCIENCE - SOCIAL STUDIES/2. Drills B/SOCIAL SCIENCE (6).pdf",
