    "title": "LET Social Studies Major: CURRENT EVENTS 2019 2020 (Part 1)",
    "body": "Source: 03. CURRENT EVENTS 2019-2020.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nSOCIAL SCIENCE\n\nCURRENT EVENTS\n2019 - 2020\n\n1. The new corona virus has started in China in the late 2019 and been steadily\nspreading across the world. What is the official name of the new coronavirus?\nA. MERS-C0V\nB. SARS-CoV-2\nC. n-CoV2\nD. COVID-19\n\n2. The pandemic of coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) first case was originated In\nwhat China's territory?\nA. Haikou, Hainan\nB. Hangzhou, Zhejiang\nC. Changsha, Hunan\nD. Wuhan, Hubei\n\n3. What is the size of the Corona virus?\nA. 120 nm in diameter\nB. 130 nm in diameter\nC. 140 nm in diameter\nD. 150 nm in diameter\n\n4. The 2019-20 coronavirus pandemic is a pandemic of \"coronavirus disease 2019\n(COVID-19)\" caused by what virus constraint?\nA. SARS-CoV-1\n\nB. SARS-CoV-2\nC. SARS-CoV-3\nD. SARS-CoV-4\n\n5. What European country becomes the first to declare an end to its COVID-19\npandemic?\nA. Slovakia\nB. Slovenia\nC. Finland\nD. Iceland\n\n6. Which of the following is NOT listed by the World Health Organization as a symptom of\ncorona virus?\nA. Nasal congestion\nB. Dry cough\nC. Fever\nD. Blurred vision\n\n7. From which country the first case of a tiger tested positive of COVID-19 has been\nreported?\nA. USA💕\nB. South Africa\nC. India\nD. Italy\n\n8. Which of the following organs in the body this corona virus primarily attack?\n\nA. Liver\nB. Heart\nC. Brain\nD. Lungs\n\n9. According to studies, how long can the corona virus survive on plastic and stainless\nsteel surfaces?\nA. 4-12 hours\nB. 13-24 hours\nC. 24-60 hours\nD. 72 hours more\n\n10. What does the number 19 in COVID 19 stand for?\nA. It is the 19th corona virus identified by the World Health Organization\nB. It refers to the 19 molecules of the virus\nC. It is the year it was first encountered: 2019\nD. It is the 19th global pandemic in the world history\n\n11. Maria Teresa has become the first royal to pass away due to COVID-19\ncomplications. She was the princess of which country?\nA. Spain\nB. England\nC. Italy\nD. Greece\n\n12. Who is the author of \"Wuhan Diary: Dispatches from a Quarantined City\" which is a\ncompilation of online diary entries and social media posts that document 60 days of\nlockdown during COVID-19?\nA. Fang Fang\nB. Hua Yu\nC. Wang Anyi\nD. Lu Xun\n\n13. According to a US-based research, a combination of reduced morbidity and\nmortality could make the BCG vaccination, a \"game changer\" in the fight against novel\ncorona virus. What does the C of BCG stands for?\nA. Cytomegalovirus\nB. Corona\nC. Calmette\nD. Ciclosporin\n\n14. Which country launched multiple short-range anti-ship cruise missiles into the sea\nwhen every country is fighting COVID-19?\nA. USA\nB. North Korea\nC. Russia\nD. China\n\n15. What is the size of the corona virus?\nA. 8 billionths of a meter in diameter\nB. 80 billionths of a meter in diameter\nC. 800 billionths of a meter in diameter\n\nD. 8000 billionths of a meter in diameter\n\n16. What is the name of first of its kind of digital contact tracing app utilizing the\nExposure Notification API of Apple and Google and based on a decentralized\napproach to track the spread of coronavirus?\nA. ZurichCovid\nB. SwissCovid\nC. SwissCorona\nD. ZurichCorona\n\n17. Google launches which app to help people maintain social distancing?\nA. Sodar\nB. Cedar\nC. Socdis\nD. Kedar\n\n18. The World Health Organization have teamed up with which organization to fight the\nbattle against Covid-19 and have signed an agreement to work together to promote\nhealth through sport and physical activity?\nA. International Olympic Committee\nB. International Sports Federation\nC. International Handball Federation\nD. World Athletics\n\n19. What is the bill that Senator Manny Pacquiao will file that will require people to\nadopt a standard hygiene and social distancing protocol amidst this COVID19\npandemic?\nA. New Normal Law\nB. Pandemic Law\nC. New Life Law\nD. COVID19 Law\n\n20. This bill was filed on March 23, 2020 to declare the existence of a national\nemergency arising from the COVID-19, authorizing Pres. Duterte to exercise powers\nnecessary and proper to carry out the declared national policy.\nA. Bayanihan to Heal as One Act\nB. Research Institute for Tropical Medicine RITM Act\nC. Anti-Spitting Act of 2020\nD. Health Emergency Lockdown Act\n\n21. When did President Rodrigo Duterte officially declare the entire Luzon area in the\nPhilippines under \"Enhanced Community Quarantine\" due to COVID-19 pandemic?\nA. March 14, 2020\nB. March 15, 2020\nC. March 16, 2020\nD. March 17, 2020\n\n22. Who was the Director-General of World Health Organization during the pandemic\nCOVID-19?\nA. Tedros Adhanom Ghebreyesus\nB. Margaret Chan\nC. Lee Jong-Wook\n\nD. Gro Harlem Brundtland\n\n23. Who is the Secretary of Department of Health during the COVID-19 pandemic?\nA. Francisco Duque Ill\nB. Karlo Nograles\nC. Rolando Joselito Bautista\nD. Leonor Briones\n\n24. What province in China did the first case of the COVID-19 originate?\nA. Hubei\nB. Hainan\nC. Henan\nD. Sichuan\n\n25. Which social-media platform launched 'Coronavirus Information Hub' in partnership\nwith WHO, UNICEF and UNDP?\nA. WhatsApp\nB. Instagram\nC. Twitter\nD. Viber\n\n26. The 2019-20 coronavirus pandemic was confirmed to have spread to Philippines on\nJanuary 30, 2020 when the first positive case involved a Chinese woman who was\nconfined in what hospital in Metro Manila?\nA. Manila Doctors Hospital\nB. Philippine General Hospital\nC. Perpetua Help Hospital\n\nD. San Lazaro Hospital\n\n27. Who was recently appointed as the new Prime Minister of Russia?\nA. Vladimir Putin\nB. Roman Goncharenko\nC. Dmitry Medvedev\nD. Mikhail Mishustin\n\n28. Which prize has been launched by Britain's Prince William that aims to encourage\nand inspire people across the world to find innovative new solutions to climate\nchange?\nA. Earthshot Prize\nB. Greenculture Prize\nC. Savearth Prize\nD. Greenenvironment Prize\n\n29. Who was the African-American man who was killed during arrest in Minnesota and\nafter his death, protests against police violence toward black people quickly spread\nacross the United States and internationally?\nA. George Floyd\nB. Michael Boyd\nC. David Hudson\nD. Denzel Goldberg\n\n30. What is '2MASS 1155-7919 b', which was recently discovered by the scientists at the\nRochester Institute of Technology?\nA. Exo-planet\n\nB. Star\nC. Asteroid\nD. Comet",
