    "body": "Source: 03. CURRENT EVENTS 2019-2020.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\n63. Who was the first director-general of World Health Organization?\nA. Tedros Adhanom Ghebreyesus\nB. Margaret Chan\nC. Lee Jong-Wook\nD. Gro Harlem Brundtland\n\n64. President Duterte has signed this law, which expands the services covered by\nPhilhealth and intends to include all Filipino citizens in the program.\nA. Philhealth Law\nB. Mandatory Philhealth Membership Law\nC. Accessible Health Law\nD. Universal Health Care Law\n\n65. On February 20, 2019, President Duterte signed Republic Act 11210 granting\nadditional leave benefits for working mothers from 60-78 days to 105 days.\nA. Extra Maternity Leave Law\nB. Expanded Maternity Leave Law\nC. Extended Maternity Leave Law\nD. Extra Maternity Leave Law\n\n66. The Bureau International des Expositions (BIE) general assembly in Paris awarded this\ncity to host the World Expo 2020.\nA. Beijing\nB. New York\nC. Paris\nD. Dubai\n\n67. As of 2019, there are six UNESCO World Heritage Sites in the Philippines. Which of the\nfollowing is the last addition to the list?\nA. Baroque Churches of the Philippines\nB. Tubbataha Reefs Natural Park\nC. Puerto Princesa Subterranean River National Park\nD. Mount Hamiguitan Range Wildlife Sanctuary\n\n68. Prince Abdul Mateen Bolkiah of Brunei was one of the popular athletes who\ncompeted in the 30th Southeast Asian Games 2019, in what sports?\nA. Swimming\nB. Golf\nC. Polo\nD. Archery\n\n69. Since 2019, more than a million people in Hong Kong marched against a\ncontroversial bill that they fear will erode freedom in semi- autonomous territory.\nA. People's Armed Police Bill\nB. Protection of Women's Rights and Interests Bill\nC. Human Rights and Democracy Act\nD. Extradition Bill\n\n70. Which of the following city will host the 2022 Asian Games?\nA. Hangzhou, China\nB. Doha, Qatar\nC. Abu Dhabi, UAE\nD. Busan, South Korea\n\n71. Which country has unveiled its first Artificial Intelligence (A1) Police officer Ella that\nstands for \"Electronic Lifelike Assistant\"?\nA. Australia\nB. New Zealand\nC. Singapore\nD. Russia\n\n72. The US space agency NASA has partnered with SpaceX, Blue Origin and Dynetics to\nbuild lunar landing systems that can carry astronauts to the moon by 2024. Who is the\nowner of Blue Origin company?\nA. Bill Gates\nB. Jeffrey Preston Bezos\nC. Larry Page\n\nD. Elon Reeve Musk\n\n73. Which global association has asked the social media platforms to provide monthly\nreport on their actions to combat fake news?\nA. United Nations\nB. European Union\nC. WHO\nD. BRICS\n\n74. What is the new deadline for qualification period of Tokyo Olympics?\nA. June 4, 2021\nB. June 29, 2021\nC. July 4, 2021\nD. July 29, 2021\n\n75. According to the 32nd edition of World Competitiveness Index 2020 which country is\non 1st position?\nA. USA\nB. China\nC. Singapore\nD. Russia\n\n76. The following are the satellites launched by the Philippines EXCEPT\nA. Agila-1\nB. Maya-1\nC. Diwata-1\n\nD. Tamaraw-1\n\n77. Who became the first woman to reach the Challenger Deep, the deepest point in\nthe ocean located in the Mariana Trench?\nA. Hally Anderson\nB. Genna Madrid\nC. Michelle Smithson\nD. Kathy Sullivan\n\n78. Which is the host city for the 2020 Palarong Pambansa?\nA. Dagupan City\nB. Cebu City\nC. Marikina City\nD. Puerto Princesa City\n\n79. What was the theme of 2020 International Day of UN Peacekeepers?\nA. Men in Peacekeeping - A path to Peace\nB. Women in Peacekeeping - A path to Peace\nC. Men in Peacekeeping - A key to Peace\nD. Women in Peacekeeping - A key to Peace💕\n\n80. What is the colour of 2020?\nA. Magenta\nB. Sunset\nC. Classic blue\nD. Creamy white\n\nANSWER KEYS\n1-10 DDABB * DADDC\n11-20 AACBB * BAAAD\n21-30 CAAAA * DDAAA\n31-40 DCABD * CADAC\n41-50 ACCAA * DADDA\n51-60 ADCAC * ABAAB\n61-70 BCDDB * DDCDA\n71-80 BBBBC * DDCDC\n\n1. The new corona virus has started in China in the late 2019 and been steadily\nspreading across the world. What is the official name of the new coronavirus?\nA. MERS-C0V\nB. SARS-CoV-2\nC. n-CoV2\nD. COVID-19💕\n\n2. The pandemic of coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) first case was originated In\nwhat China's territory?\nA. Haikou, Hainan\nB. Hangzhou, Zhejiang\nC. Changsha, Hunan\nD. Wuhan, Hubei💕\n\n3. What is the size of the Corona virus?\n\nA. 120 nm in diameter💕\nB. 130 nm in diameter\nC. 140 nm in diameter\nD. 150 nm in diameter\n\n4. The 2019-20 coronavirus pandemic is a pandemic of \"coronavirus disease 2019\n(COVID-19)\" caused by what virus constraint?\nA. SARS-CoV-1\nB. SARS-CoV-2💕\nC. SARS-CoV-3\nD. SARS-CoV-4\n\n5. What European country becomes the first to declare an end to its COVID-19\npandemic?\nA. Slovakia\nB. Slovenia💕\nC. Finland\nD. Iceland\n\n6. Which of the following is NOT listed by the World Health Organization as a symptom of\ncorona virus?\nA. Nasal congestion\nB. Dry cough\nC. Fever\nD. Blurred vision💕\n\n7. From which country the first case of a tiger tested positive of COVID-19 has been\nreported?\nA. USA💕\nB. South Africa\nC. India\nD. Italy\n\n8. Which of the following organs in the body this corona virus primarily attack?\nA. Liver\nB. Heart\nC. Brain\nD. Lungs💕\n\n9. According to studies, how long can the corona virus survive on plastic and stainless\nsteel surfaces?\nA. 4-12 hours\nB. 13-24 hours\nC. 24-60 hours\nD. 72 hours more💕\n\n10. What does the number 19 in COVID 19 stand for?\nA. It is the 19th corona virus identified by the World Health Organization\nB. It refers to the 19 molecules of the virus\nC. It is the year it was first encountered: 2019💕\nD. It is the 19th global pandemic in the world history\n\n11. Maria Teresa has become the first royal to pass away due to COVID-19\ncomplications. She was the princess of which country?\nA. Spain💕\nB. England\nC. Italy\nD. Greece\n\n12. Who is the author of \"Wuhan Diary: Dispatches from a Quarantined City\" which is a\ncompilation of online diary entries and social media posts that document 60 days of\nlockdown during COVID-19?\nA. Fang Fang💕\nB. Hua Yu\nC. Wang Anyi\nD. Lu Xun\n\n13. According to a US-based research, a combination of reduced morbidity and\nmortality could make the BCG vaccination, a \"game changer\" in the fight against novel\ncorona virus. What does the C of BCG stands for?\nA. Cytomegalovirus\nB. Corona\nC. Calmette💕\nD. Ciclosporin\n\n14. Which country launched multiple short-range anti-ship cruise missiles into the sea\nwhen every country is fighting COVID-19?\nA. USA\nB. North Korea💕\nC. Russia\n\nD. China\n\n15. What is the size of the corona virus?\nA. 8 billionths of a meter in diameter\nB. 80 billionths of a meter in diameter💕\nC. 800 billionths of a meter in diameter\nD. 8000 billionths of a meter in diameter",
