    "body": "Source: 03. CURRENT EVENTS 2019-2020.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\n16. What is the name of first of its kind of digital contact tracing app utilizing the\nExposure Notification API of Apple and Google and based on a decentralized\napproach to track the spread of coronavirus?\nA. ZurichCovid\nB. SwissCovid💕\nC. SwissCorona\nD. ZurichCorona\n\n17. Google launches which app to help people maintain social distancing?\nA. Sodar💕\nB. Cedar\nC. Socdis\nD. Kedar\n\n18. The World Health Organization have teamed up with which organization to fight the\nbattle against Covid-19 and have signed an agreement to work together to promote\nhealth through sport and physical activity?\nA. International Olympic Committee💕\nB. International Sports Federation\nC. International Handball Federation\nD. World Athletics\n\n19. What is the bill that Senator Manny Pacquiao will file that will require people to\nadopt a standard hygiene and social distancing protocol amidst this COVID19\npandemic?\nA. New Normal Law💕\nB. Pandemic Law\nC. New Life Law\nD. COVID19 Law\n\n20. This bill was filed on March 23, 2020 to declare the existence of a national\nemergency arising from the COVID-19, authorizing Pres. Duterte to exercise powers\nnecessary and proper to carry out the declared national policy.\nA. Bayanihan to Heal as One Act\nB. Research Institute for Tropical Medicine RITM Act\nC. Anti-Spitting Act of 2020\nD. Health Emergency Lockdown Act💕\n\n21. When did President Rodrigo Duterte officially declare the entire Luzon area in the\nPhilippines under \"Enhanced Community Quarantine\" due to COVID-19 pandemic?\nA. March 14, 2020\nB. March 15, 2020\n\nC. March 16, 2020💕\nD. March 17, 2020\n\n22. Who was the Director-General of World Health Organization during the pandemic\nCOVID-19?\nA. Tedros Adhanom Ghebreyesus💕\nB. Margaret Chan\nC. Lee Jong-Wook\nD. Gro Harlem Brundtland\n\n23. Who is the Secretary of Department of Health during the COVID-19 pandemic?\nA. Francisco Duque Ill💕\nB. Karlo Nograles\nC. Rolando Joselito Bautista\nD. Leonor Briones\n\n24. What province in China did the first case of the COVID-19 originate?\nA. Hubei💕\nB. Hainan\nC. Henan\nD. Sichuan\n\n25. Which social-media platform launched 'Coronavirus Information Hub' in partnership\nwith WHO, UNICEF and UNDP?\nA. WhatsApp💕\nB. Instagram\n\nC. Twitter\nD. Viber\n\n26. The 2019-20 coronavirus pandemic was confirmed to have spread to Philippines on\nJanuary 30, 2020 when the first positive case involved a Chinese woman who was\nconfined in what hospital in Metro Manila?\nA. Manila Doctors Hospital\nB. Philippine General Hospital\nC. Perpetua Help Hospital\nD. San Lazaro Hospital💕\n\n27. Who was recently appointed as the new Prime Minister of Russia?\nA. Vladimir Putin\nB. Roman Goncharenko\nC. Dmitry Medvedev\nD. Mikhail Mishustin💕\n\n28. Which prize has been launched by Britain's Prince William that aims to encourage\nand inspire people across the world to find innovative new solutions to climate\nchange?\nA. Earthshot Prize💕\nB. Greenculture Prize\nC. Savearth Prize\nD. Greenenvironment Prize\n\n29. Who was the African-American man who was killed during arrest in Minnesota and\nafter his death, protests against police violence toward black people quickly spread\nacross the United States and internationally?\n\nA. George Floyd💕\nB. Michael Boyd\nC. David Hudson\nD. Denzel Goldberg\n\n30. What is '2MASS 1155-7919 b', which was recently discovered by the scientists at the\nRochester Institute of Technology?\nA. Exo-planet💕\nB. Star\nC. Asteroid\nD. Comet\n\n31. On January 21, 2019, a plebiscite takes place with the majority of voters deciding to\nratify the _____________ paving way to the creation of the Bangsamoro Autonomous\nRegion and abolition of the Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao.\nA. Bangsamoro Independence Law\nB. Bangsamoro Republic Law\nC. Bangsamoro Autonomy Law\nD. Bangsamoro Organic Law💕\n\n32. Which country has developed \"i-Feel you\", an intelligent bracelet which will help\nusers respect social distancing rules?\nA. Germany\nB. France\nC. Italy💕\nD. Ukraine\n\n33. Who is the US Secretary of State who condemned the exclusion of Taiwan from the\nWorld Health Assembly (WHA)?\nA. Michael Pompeo💕\nB. Thomas Jefferson\nC. Gina Haspel\nD. Ron Estes\n\n34. The world's highest railway bridge will connect rest of the India with which city?\nA. Ladakh\nB. Kashmir💕\nC. Chail\nD. Munnar\n\n35. On January 27, 2019, at least 20 people were killed while 111 people were injured as\nexplosions rocked the Cathedral of Our Lady of Mount Carmel in _________.\nA. Patikul, Sulu\nB. Davao City\nC. Lamitan, Basilan\nD. Jolo, Sulu💕\n\n36. What volcano that spewed hazardous eruption last 13th of January, 2020 where all\nresidents near the volcano were advised to evacuate for safety purposes?\nA. Mayon Volcano\nB. Canlaon Volcano\nC. Taal Volcano💕\nD. Mount Pinatubo\n\n37. What is the hottest temperature recorded in Antarctica as per World Meteorological\nOrganization last February, 2020?\nA. 69.4 °F💕\nB. 58.7 °F\nC. 75.2 °F\nD. 81.3 °F\n\n38. Which country recently launched a driver-less bullet train capable to ply with a\nspeed up to 350 kilometers per hour and also features 5G connectivity?\nA. USA\nB. Russia\nC. Japan\nD. China💕\n\n39. The current Speaker the House of the 18th Congress\nA. Allan Peter Cayetano💕\nB. Gloria Macapagal Arroyo\nC. Sonny Belmonte\nD. Martin Romualdez\n\n40. The current Senate President of the 18th Congress.\nA. Alan Peter Cayetano\nB. Franklin Drilon\nC. Vicente Sotto 💕\nD. Aquilino Pimentel\n\n41. The Philippine Navy Ship that made history by completing the country's first-ever port\ncall in Russia.\nA. BRP Tarlac💕\nB. BRP Gregorio del Pilar\nC. BRP Ramon Alcaraz\nD. BRP Davao del Sur\n\n42. He is the Philippine President who implemented the Nationwide Smoking Ban.\nA. Benigno Aquino Ill\nB. Fidel Ramos\nC. Rodrigo Duterte💕\nD. Joseph Estrada\n\n43. On April 30, 2019, he was arrested by the NBI for sharing \"Bikoy\" videos accusing\nPresident Rodrigo Duterte and his family of their involvement in the illegal drug trade.\nA. Maria Ressa\nB. Peter Joemel Advincula\nC. Rodel Jayme 💕\nD. Senator Antonio Trillanes\n\n44. The PH-US Visiting Forces Agreement is a bilateral visiting forces agreement between\nthe Philippines and the United States. On what date did President Duterte announced\nthat he is ending the pact between the two countries?\nA. February 11, 2020 💕\nB. January 25, 2020\nC. February 15, 2020\n\nD. February 25, 2020\n\n45. Which city has been named World Book Capital for 2020?\nA. Kuala Lumpur💕\nB. Hanoi\nC. Singapore City\nD. Taipei",
