    "body": "Source: 03. CURRENT EVENTS 2019-2020.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\n46. On October II, 2019, Ethiopian Prime Minister ________________ was awarded the\nNobel\nPeace Prize for helping his country end their 20-year war with Eritrea.\nA. Andrew Holness\nB. Uhuru Kenyatta\nC. Mokgweetsi Masisi\nD. Abiy Ahmed💕\n\n47. On October 18, 2019, two NASA astronauts Christina Koch and __________________\nmade history by completing the first all-woman spacewalk. They spent 7 hours outside\nthe International Space Station to fix a power issue.\nA. Jessica Meir💕\nB. Anne McClain\nC. Sally Ride\nD. Peggy Whitson\n\n48. Who was the President of Bolivia who resigned on November 11, 2019 after his 14year reign? Massive protesters accused him of election fraud.\nA. Hugo Banzer\n\nB. Carlos Mesa\nC. Eduardo Rodriguez\nD. Evo Morales💕\n\n49. In what Asian country passed a controversial bill that gives citizenship to immigrants\nfrom its three neighboring countries, but not if they are Muslim?\nA. Indonesia\nB. Taiwan\nC. Singapore\nD. India💕\n\n50. Which of the following countries successfully launched its most powerful rocket\n\"Long March-5B\" on its maiden voyage into orbit last 5th of May, 2020?\nA. China💕\nB. Brazil\nC. Russia\nD. South Africa\n\n51. Who was the world's youngest prime minister elected on December 9, 2019 in\nFinland?\nA. Sanna Marin💕\nB. Antti Rinne\nC. Juha Sipila\nD. Alexander Stubb\n\n52. Which delegation won the overall ranking in the 30th Southeast Asian Games 2019\nhaving a medal tally of 149 gold, 117 silver, and 121 bronze?\n\nA. Vietnam\nB. Thailand\nC. Indonesia\nD. Philippines💕\n\n53. Which country hosted the 34th ASEAN Summit last June 20-23, 2019?\nA. Vietnam\nB. Singapore\nC. Thailand💕\nD. Philippines\n\n54. The following are the new sports coming to the 2020 Summer Olympics EXCEPT\nA. Water polo💕\nB. Skateboarding\nC. Sport Climbing\nD. Surfing\n\n55. Who was the winning physicist who died last April 1, 2020 and expanded the world's\nunderstanding of magnetism, superconductivity and the structure of matter?\nA. Paul Dirac\nB. Enrico Fermi\nC. Philip Warren Andersen💕\nD. Hans Bethe\n\n56. The fifth state of matter has been observed by the scientists for the first time in\nspace. What is the name of fifth state of matter?\n\nA. Bose-Einstein condensates💕\nB. Bose-Newton condensates\nC. Bose-Curie condensates\nD. Bose-Darwin condensates\n\n57. According to Article 31 of the ASEAN Charter, the Chairmanship of ASEAN shall\nrotate annually, based on the alphabetical order of the English names of Member\nStates. After Singapore chaired and hosted the ASEAN summit last 2018, what country\nwill assume the Chairmanship this 2019?\nA. Taiwan\nB. Thailand 💕\nC. Tonga\nD. Tajikistan\n\n58. Who is the first and youngest tribal woman in the world to climb six tallest mountain\npeaks across six continents?\nA. Malavath Poorna💕\nB. Anuja Vaidya\nC. Shivangi Pathak\nD. Aditi Vaidya\n\n59. What is the name of China's first Mars exploration mission as it celebrated Space\nDay last 24th of April, 2020?\nA. Tianwen-l💕\nB. Cianwen-l\nC. Rianwen-l\nD. Bianwen-l\n\n60. What are the 24-hour nationwide emergency hotlines?\nA. 999 and 911\nB. 8888 and 911💕\nC. 8888 and 117\nD. 2363 and 911\n\n61. This volcano erupted on January 12, 2020, 43 years after its previous eruption in 1977.\nIt has reached Alert Level 4 resulted to mass evacuation of residents in different parts of\nthe province.\nA. Mayon Volcano\nB. Taal Volcano💕\nC. Mount Pinatubo\nD. Mount Kanlaon\n\n62. Where will 2020 Summer Olympics be held?\nA. Argentina\nB. New Zealand\nC. Japan💕\nD. UAE\n\n63. Who was the first director-general of World Health Organization?\nA. Tedros Adhanom Ghebreyesus\nB. Margaret Chan\nC. Lee Jong-Wook\nD. Gro Harlem Brundtland💕\n\n64. President Duterte has signed this law, which expands the services covered by\nPhilhealth and intends to include all Filipino citizens in the program.\nA. Philhealth Law\nB. Mandatory Philhealth Membership Law\nC. Accessible Health Law\nD. Universal Health Care Law💕\n\n65. On February 20, 2019, President Duterte signed Republic Act 11210 granting\nadditional leave benefits for working mothers from 60-78 days to 105 days.\nA. Extra Maternity Leave Law\nB. Expanded Maternity Leave Law 💕\nC. Extended Maternity Leave Law\nD. Extra Maternity Leave Law\n\n66. The Bureau International des Expositions (BIE) general assembly in Paris awarded this\ncity to host the World Expo 2020.\nA. Beijing\nB. New York\nC. Paris\nD. Dubai💕\n\n67. As of 2019, there are six UNESCO World Heritage Sites in the Philippines. Which of the\nfollowing is the last addition to the list?\nA. Baroque Churches of the Philippines\nB. Tubbataha Reefs Natural Park\nC. Puerto Princesa Subterranean River National Park\n\nD. Mount Hamiguitan Range Wildlife Sanctuary💕\n\n68. Prince Abdul Mateen Bolkiah of Brunei was one of the popular athletes who\ncompeted in the 30th Southeast Asian Games 2019, in what sports?\nA. Swimming\nB. Golf\nC. Polo💕\nD. Archery\n\n69. Since 2019, more than a million people in Hong Kong marched against a\ncontroversial bill that they fear will erode freedom in semi- autonomous territory.\nA. People's Armed Police Bill\nB. Protection of Women's Rights and Interests Bill\nC. Human Rights and Democracy Act\nD. Extradition Bill💕\n\n70. Which of the following city will host the 2022 Asian Games?\nA. Hangzhou, China💕\nB. Doha, Qatar\nC. Abu Dhabi, UAE\nD. Busan, South Korea\n\n71. Which country has unveiled its first Artificial Intelligence (A1) Police officer Ella that\nstands for \"Electronic Lifelike Assistant\"?\nA. Australia\nB. New Zealand💕\n\nC. Singapore\nD. Russia\n\n72. The US space agency NASA has partnered with SpaceX, Blue Origin and Dynetics to\nbuild lunar landing systems that can carry astronauts to the moon by 2024. Who is the\nowner of Blue Origin company?\nA. Bill Gates\nB. Jeffrey Preston Bezos💕\nC. Larry Page\nD. Elon Reeve Musk\n\n73. Which global association has asked the social media platforms to provide monthly\nreport on their actions to combat fake news?\nA. United Nations\nB. European Union💕\nC. WHO\nD. BRICS\n\n74. What is the new deadline for qualification period of Tokyo Olympics?\nA. June 4, 2021\nB. June 29, 2021💕\nC. July 4, 2021\nD. July 29, 2021\n\n75. According to the 32nd edition of World Competitiveness Index 2020 which country is\non 1st position?\nA. USA\n\nB. China\nC. Singapore💕\nD. Russia\n\n76. The following are the satellites launched by the Philippines EXCEPT\nA. Agila-1\nB. Maya-1\nC. Diwata-1\nD. Tamaraw-1💕\n\n77. Who became the first woman to reach the Challenger Deep, the deepest point in\nthe ocean located in the Mariana Trench?\nA. Hally Anderson\nB. Genna Madrid\nC. Michelle Smithson\nD. Kathy Sullivan💕",
