    "body": "Source: 04. CURRENT EVENTS.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\n27. She won the 4th and last gold medal for the\nPhilippines in the 2018 Asian Games women's\nstreet skateboard event in Jakarta and\nPalembang, Indonesia.\n\n31. He is the Philippine president who\nimplemented the Nationwide Smoking Ban.\n\nA. Margielyn Didal✔\nB. Yuka Saso\nC. Lois Kaye Go\n\nA. Rodrigo Duterte✔\nB. Benigno Aquino III\nC. Joseph Ejercito Estrada\nD. Fidel Ramos\n\nD. Bianca Pagdanganan\n\n28. In his 3rd State of the Nation Address (SONA),\nPresident Rodrigo Duterte's speech lasted for\nhow many minutes?\nA. 48 minutes✔\nB. 35 minutes\nC. 40 minutes\nD. 30 minutes\n\n32. An Executive Order issued by President\nDuterte which allows accessibility of documents\nand other transactions in the government to\nensure transparency and accountability.\nA. None of these\nB. Freedom of Information✔\nC. Anti-dynasty law\nD. Reproductive health law\n\n33. It is also known as PHL-Microsat-1, a\nPhilippine microsatellite launched to the\nInternational Space Station (ISS) on March 23,\n2016.\nA. Diwata 1✔\nB. Diyosa 1\nC. Encantadia 1\nD. Marikit",
