    "body": "Source: 05. IMPORTANT.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\n1.\n\nApolinario de la Cruz- Hermano Pule\n\n2.\n\nLongest Revolt against Spain(Lasted 85years)- DAGOHOY\n\n3.\n\nMi Ultimo Adios Tagalog Translation- BONIFACIO\n\n4.\n\nExiled to Guam- A. MABINI\n\n5.\n\nExiled to Hawaii- F. MARCOS\n\n6.\n\nMan of the Masses- MAGSAYSAY\n\n7.\n\nFather of the Masses- ERAP\n\n8.\n\nCommander of HUKBALAHAP - LUIS TARUC\n\n9.\n\nFirst speaker of the house of the Philippine Assembly- OSMEÑA\n\n10.\n\nAmerican President Who visited First in Republic of China- NIXON\n\n11.\n\nGreat body of salty water smaller than ocean- SEA\n\n12.\n\nHighest Mountain in Luzon- Mt.Pulag\n\n13.\n\nMost active Volcano-Kanlaon( Negros Region)\n\n14.\n\nMost destructive Volcanic Eruption happened in 20th century- Mt.Pinatubo\n\n15.\n\nA country with less than a $200dollar Annual per capita income belongs to?- Fourth World\n\n16.\n\nLegal age in Entering Marriage under the Family code- 18 years old\n\n17.\n\nPhilippine consist of how many Islands- 7,641",
