    "title": "LET Social Studies Major: PHILIPPINE CONSTITUTION II",
    "body": "Source: 14. PHILIPPINE CONSTITUTION II.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nPHILIPPINE CONSTITUTION II\n1. We, the ______ Filipino people ...\nA. free\nB. independent\nC. sovereign\nD. blessed\n2. Imploring the aid of __________________. (Two Words; religious being)\nAnswer: ________________________\n3. In order to build a just and _____ society ...\nA. perfect\nB. humane\nC. equal\nD. caring\n4. And establish a government that shall _____ our ideals and aspirations.\nA. embody\nB. protect\nC. represent\nD. serve\n5. Promote the common good, conserve and develop our ________.\nA. posterity\nB. natural resources\nC. environment\nD. patrimony\n6. And secure to ourselves and our _______ ...\nA. patrimony\n\nB. aspirations\nC. faith\nD. posterity\n7. The blessings of independence and _________ under the rule of law.\n(One Word; a type of government)\nAnswer: ________________________\n8. And a __________ of truth, justice, freedom, love, equality, and peace. (One Word; an\ninfamous synonym for a type of government)\nAnswer: ________________________\n9. Do _______________.\nA. bless\nB. approve\nC. annoint\nD. ordain\n10. And _____________ this constitution.\nA. ordain\nB. promulgate\nC. anoint\nD. bless\n\nANSWER KEY:\n1. C\n2. Almighty God\n3. B\n4. A\n5. D\n6. D\n7. Democracy\n8. Regime\n9. D\n10. B",
