    "body": "Source: 18. SOCIAL SCIENCE - CURRENT EVENTS.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nSOCIAL SCIENCE\n\nD. SARS-CoV-4\n\nCURRENT EVENTS\n1. The new corona virus has started in China in\nthe late 2019 and been steadily spreading\nacross the world. What is the official name of\nthe new coronavirus?\nA. MERS-C0V\nB. SARS-CoV-2\nC. n-CoV2\n\n5. What European country becomes the first to\ndeclare an end to its COVID-19 pandemic?\nA. Slovakia\nB. Slovenia💕\nC. Finland\nD. Iceland\n\nD. COVID-19💕\n\n2. The pandemic of coronavirus disease 2019\n(COVID-19) first case was originated In what\nChina's territory?\nA. Haikou, Hainan\nB. Hangzhou, Zhejiang\nC. Changsha, Hunan\n\n6. Which of the following is NOT listed by the\nWorld Health Organization as a symptom of\ncorona virus?\nA. Nasal congestion\nB. Dry cough\nC. Fever\nD. Blurred vision💕\n\nD. Wuhan, Hubei💕\n\n3. What is the size of the Corona virus?\n\n7. From which country the first case of a tiger\ntested positive of COVID-19 has been\nreported?\n\nA. 120 nm in diameter💕\n\nA. USA💕\n\nB. 130 nm in diameter\n\nB. South Africa\n\nC. 140 nm in diameter\n\nC. India\n\nD. 150 nm in diameter\n\nD. Italy\n\n4. The 2019-20 coronavirus pandemic is a\npandemic of \"coronavirus disease 2019\n(COVID-19)\" caused by what virus constraint?\n\n8. Which of the following organs in the body\nthis corona virus primarily attack?\n\nA. SARS-CoV-1\nB. SARS-CoV-2💕\nC. SARS-CoV-3\n\nA. Liver\nB. Heart\nC. Brain\n\nD. Lungs💕\n\nA. Fang Fang💕\nB. Hua Yu\n\n9. According to studies, how long can the\ncorona virus survive on plastic and stainless\nsteel surfaces?\n\nC. Wang Anyi\nD. Lu Xun\n\nA. 4-12 hours\nB. 13-24 hours\nC. 24-60 hours\nD. 72 hours more💕\n\n10. What does the number 19 in COVID 19\nstand for?\nA. It is the 19th corona virus identified by the\nWorld Health Organization\nB. It refers to the 19 molecules of the virus\n\n13. According to a US-based research, a\ncombination of reduced morbidity and\nmortality could make the BCG vaccination, a\n\"game changer\" in the fight against novel\ncorona virus. What does the C of BCG stands\nfor?\nA. Cytomegalovirus\nB. Corona\nC. Calmette💕\nD. Ciclosporin\n\nC. It is the year it was first encountered: 2019💕\nD. It is the 19th global pandemic in the world\nhistory\n\n14. Which country launched multiple shortrange anti-ship cruise missiles into the sea when\nevery country is fighting COVID-19?\nA. USA\n\n11. Maria Teresa has become the first royal to\npass away due to COVID-19 complications.\nShe was the princess of which country?\n\nB. North Korea💕\n\nA. Spain💕\n\nD. China\n\nC. Russia\n\nB. England\nC. Italy\n\n15. What is the size of the corona virus?\n\nD. Greece\n\nA. 8 billionths of a meter in diameter\nB. 80 billionths of a meter in diameter💕\n\n12. Who is the author of \"Wuhan Diary:\nDispatches from a Quarantined City\" which is a\ncompilation of online diary entries and social\nmedia posts that document 60 days of\nlockdown during COVID-19?\n\nC. 800 billionths of a meter in diameter\nD. 8000 billionths of a meter in diameter\n\n16. What is the name of first of its kind of digital\ncontact tracing app utilizing the Exposure\nNotification API of Apple and Google and\nbased on a decentralized approach to track\nthe spread of coronavirus?\nA. ZurichCovid\nB. SwissCovid💕\n\ndistancing protocol amidst this COVID19\npandemic?\nA. New Normal Law💕\nB. Pandemic Law\nC. New Life Law\nD. COVID19 Law\n\nC. SwissCorona\nD. ZurichCorona\n\n17. Google launches which app to help\npeople maintain social distancing?\nA. Sodar💕\n\n20. This bill was filed on March 23, 2020 to\ndeclare the existence of a national\nemergency arising from the COVID-19,\nauthorizing Pres. Duterte to exercise powers\nnecessary and proper to carry out the\ndeclared national policy.\nA. Bayanihan to Heal as One Act\n\nB. Cedar\n\nB. Research Institute for Tropical Medicine RITM\nAct\n\nC. Socdis\n\nC. Anti-Spitting Act of 2020\n\nD. Kedar\n\nD. Health Emergency Lockdown Act💕\n\n18. The World Health Organization have\nteamed up with which organization to fight the\nbattle against Covid-19 and have signed an\nagreement to work together to promote\nhealth through sport and physical activity?\nA. International Olympic Committee💕\nB. International Sports Federation\nC. International Handball Federation\n\n21. When did President Rodrigo Duterte\nofficially declare the entire Luzon area in the\nPhilippines under \"Enhanced Community\nQuarantine\" due to COVID-19 pandemic?\nA. March 14, 2020\nB. March 15, 2020\nC. March 16, 2020💕\nD. March 17, 2020\n\nD. World Athletics\n\n19. What is the bill that Senator Manny\nPacquiao will file that will require people to\nadopt a standard hygiene and social\n\n22. Who was the Director-General of World\nHealth Organization during the pandemic\nCOVID-19?\nA. Tedros Adhanom Ghebreyesus💕\nB. Margaret Chan\n\nC. Lee Jong-Wook\n\nB. Philippine General Hospital\n\nD. Gro Harlem Brundtland\n\nC. Perpetua Help Hospital\nD. San Lazaro Hospital💕\n\n23. Who is the Secretary of Department of\nHealth during the COVID-19 pandemic?\nA. Francisco Duque Ill💕\n\n27. Who was recently appointed as the new\nPrime Minister of Russia?\n\nB. Karlo Nograles\n\nA. Vladimir Putin\n\nC. Rolando Joselito Bautista\n\nB. Roman Goncharenko\n\nD. Leonor Briones\n\nC. Dmitry Medvedev\nD. Mikhail Mishustin💕\n\n24. What province in China did the first case of\nthe COVID-19 originate?\nA. Hubei💕\nB. Hainan\nC. Henan\nD. Sichuan\n\n28. Which prize has been launched by Britain's\nPrince William that aims to encourage and\ninspire people across the world to find\ninnovative new solutions to climate change?\nA. Earthshot Prize💕\nB. Greenculture Prize\nC. Savearth Prize\n\n25. Which social-media platform launched\n'Coronavirus Information Hub' in partnership\nwith WHO, UNICEF and UNDP?\nA. WhatsApp💕\nB. Instagram\nC. Twitter\nD. Viber\n\n26. The 2019-20 coronavirus pandemic was\nconfirmed to have spread to Philippines on\nJanuary 30, 2020 when the first positive case