    "body": "Source: 18. SOCIAL SCIENCE - CURRENT EVENTS.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\n31. On January 21, 2019, a plebiscite takes\nplace with the majority of voters deciding to\nratify the _____________ paving way to the\ncreation of the Bangsamoro Autonomous\nRegion and abolition of the Autonomous\nRegion in Muslim Mindanao.\n\nD. Munnar\n\nA. Bangsamoro Independence Law\n\n35. On January 27, 2019, at least 20 people\nwere killed while 111 people were injured as\nexplosions rocked the Cathedral of Our Lady\nof Mount Carmel in _________.\n\nB. Bangsamoro Republic Law\n\nA. Patikul, Sulu\n\nC. Bangsamoro Autonomy Law\n\nB. Davao City\n\nD. Bangsamoro Organic Law💕\n\nC. Lamitan, Basilan\nD. Jolo, Sulu💕\n\n32. Which country has developed \"i-Feel you\",\nan intelligent bracelet which will help users\nrespect social distancing rules?\nA. Germany\nB. France\nC. Italy💕\nD. Ukraine\n\n36. What volcano that spewed hazardous\neruption last 13th of January, 2020 where all\nresidents near the volcano were advised to\nevacuate for safety purposes?\nA. Mayon Volcano\nB. Canlaon Volcano\nC. Taal Volcano💕\n\n33. Who is the US Secretary of State who\ncondemned the exclusion of Taiwan from the\nWorld Health Assembly (WHA)?\nA. Michael Pompeo💕\nB. Thomas Jefferson\n\nD. Mount Pinatubo\n\n37. What is the hottest temperature recorded\nin Antarctica as per World Meteorological\nOrganization last February, 2020?\nA. 69.4 °F💕\n\nB. 58.7 °F\n\nB. BRP Gregorio del Pilar\n\nC. 75.2 °F\n\nC. BRP Ramon Alcaraz\n\nD. 81.3 °F\n\nD. BRP Davao del Sur\n\n38. Which country recently launched a driverless bullet train capable to ply with a speed up\nto 350 kilometers per hour and also features 5G\nconnectivity?\n\n42. He is the Philippine President who\nimplemented the Nationwide Smoking Ban.\n\nA. USA\n\nB. Fidel Ramos\n\nB. Russia\n\nC. Rodrigo Duterte💕\n\nC. Japan\n\nD. Joseph Estrada\n\nA. Benigno Aquino Ill\n\nD. China💕\n\n39. The current Speaker the House of the 18th\nCongress\n\n43. On April 30, 2019, he was arrested by the\nNBI for sharing \"Bikoy\" videos accusing\nPresident Rodrigo Duterte and his family of their\ninvolvement in the illegal drug trade.\n\nA. Allan Peter Cayetano💕\n\nA. Maria Ressa\n\nB. Gloria Macapagal Arroyo\n\nB. Peter Joemel Advincula\n\nC. Sonny Belmonte\n\nC. Rodel Jayme 💕\n\nD. Martin Romualdez\n\nD. Senator Antonio Trillanes\n\n40. The current Senate President of the 18th\nCongress.\n\nB. Franklin Drilon\n\n44. The PH-US Visiting Forces Agreement is a\nbilateral visiting forces agreement between\nthe Philippines and the United States. On what\ndate did President Duterte announced that he\nis ending the pact between the two countries?\n\nC. Vicente Sotto 💕\n\nA. February 11, 2020 💕\n\nD. Aquilino Pimentel\n\nB. January 25, 2020\n\nA. Alan Peter Cayetano\n\nC. February 15, 2020\n41. The Philippine Navy Ship that made history\nby completing the country's first-ever port call\nin Russia.\nA. BRP Tarlac💕\n\nD. February 25, 2020\n\n45. Which city has been named World Book\nCapital for 2020?\n\nA. Kuala Lumpur💕\n\nD. Evo Morales💕\n\nB. Hanoi\nC. Singapore City\nD. Taipei\n\n46. On October II, 2019, Ethiopian Prime\nMinister ________________ was awarded the\nNobel\nPeace Prize for helping his country end their 20year war with Eritrea.\n\n49. In what Asian country passed a\ncontroversial bill that gives citizenship to\nimmigrants from its three neighboring countries,\nbut not if they are Muslim?\nA. Indonesia\nB. Taiwan\nC. Singapore\nD. India💕\n\nA. Andrew Holness\nB. Uhuru Kenyatta\nC. Mokgweetsi Masisi\nD. Abiy Ahmed💕\n\n50. Which of the following countries\nsuccessfully launched its most powerful rocket\n\"Long March-5B\" on its maiden voyage into\norbit last 5th of May, 2020?\nA. China💕\n\n47. On October 18, 2019, two NASA astronauts\nChristina Koch and __________________ made\nhistory by completing the first all-woman\nspacewalk. They spent 7 hours outside the\nInternational Space Station to fix a power issue.\nA. Jessica Meir💕\nB. Anne McClain\nC. Sally Ride\nD. Peggy Whitson\n\nB. Brazil\nC. Russia\nD. South Africa\n\n51. Who was the world's youngest prime\nminister elected on December 9, 2019 in\nFinland?\nA. Sanna Marin💕\nB. Antti Rinne\n\n48. Who was the President of Bolivia who\nresigned on November 11, 2019 after his 14year reign? Massive protesters accused him of\nelection fraud.\nA. Hugo Banzer\nB. Carlos Mesa\nC. Eduardo Rodriguez\n\nC. Juha Sipila\nD. Alexander Stubb\n\n52. Which delegation won the overall ranking\nin the 30th Southeast Asian Games 2019 having\na medal tally of 149 gold, 117 silver, and 121\nbronze?\n\nA. Vietnam\n\nA. Bose-Einstein condensates💕\n\nB. Thailand\n\nB. Bose-Newton condensates\n\nC. Indonesia\n\nC. Bose-Curie condensates\n\nD. Philippines💕\n\nD. Bose-Darwin condensates\n\n53. Which country hosted the 34th ASEAN\nSummit last June 20-23, 2019?\n\nC. Thailand💕\n\n57. According to Article 31 of the ASEAN\nCharter, the Chairmanship of ASEAN shall\nrotate annually, based on the alphabetical\norder of the English names of Member States.\nAfter Singapore chaired and hosted the ASEAN\nsummit last 2018, what country will assume the\nChairmanship this 2019?\n\nD. Philippines\n\nA. Taiwan\n\nA. Vietnam\nB. Singapore\n\nB. Thailand 💕\n54. The following are the new sports coming to\nthe 2020 Summer Olympics EXCEPT\n\nC. Tonga\nD. Tajikistan\n\nA. Water polo💕\nB. Skateboarding\nC. Sport Climbing\nD. Surfing\n\n58. Who is the first and youngest tribal woman\nin the world to climb six tallest mountain peaks\nacross six continents?\nA. Malavath Poorna💕\n\n55. Who was the winning physicist who died\nlast April 1, 2020 and expanded the world's\nunderstanding of magnetism,\nsuperconductivity and the structure of matter?\n\nB. Anuja Vaidya\nC. Shivangi Pathak\nD. Aditi Vaidya\n\nA. Paul Dirac\n\nC. Philip Warren Andersen💕\n\n59. What is the name of China's first Mars\nexploration mission as it celebrated Space Day\nlast 24th of April, 2020?\n\nD. Hans Bethe\n\nA. Tianwen-l💕\n\nB. Enrico Fermi\n\nB. Cianwen-l\n56. The fifth state of matter has been observed\nby the scientists for the first time in space. What\nis the name of fifth state of matter?\n\nC. Rianwen-l\nD. Bianwen-l\n\n60. What are the 24-hour nationwide\nemergency hotlines?\nA. 999 and 911\n\n64. President Duterte has signed this law, which\nexpands the services covered by Philhealth\nand intends to include all Filipino citizens in the\nprogram.\n\nB. 8888 and 911💕\n\nA. Philhealth Law\n\nC. 8888 and 117\n\nB. Mandatory Philhealth Membership Law\n\nD. 2363 and 911\n\nC. Accessible Health Law\nD. Universal Health Care Law💕\n\n61. This volcano erupted on January 12, 2020,\n43 years after its previous eruption in 1977. It\nhas reached Alert Level 4 resulted to mass\nevacuation of residents in different parts of the\nprovince.\nA. Mayon Volcano\nB. Taal Volcano💕\nC. Mount Pinatubo\nD. Mount Kanlaon",
