    "body": "Source: 18. SOCIAL SCIENCE - CURRENT EVENTS.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\n65. On February 20, 2019, President Duterte\nsigned Republic Act 11210 granting additional\nleave benefits for working mothers from 60-78\ndays to 105 days.\nA. Extra Maternity Leave Law\nB. Expanded Maternity Leave Law 💕\nC. Extended Maternity Leave Law\nD. Extra Maternity Leave Law\n\n62. Where will 2020 Summer Olympics be held?\n\nB. New Zealand\n\n66. The Bureau International des Expositions\n(BIE) general assembly in Paris awarded this\ncity to host the World Expo 2020.\n\nC. Japan💕\n\nA. Beijing\n\nA. Argentina\n\nD. UAE\n\nB. New York\nC. Paris\n\n63. Who was the first director-general of World\nHealth Organization?\nA. Tedros Adhanom Ghebreyesus\nB. Margaret Chan\nC. Lee Jong-Wook\nD. Gro Harlem Brundtland💕\n\nD. Dubai💕\n\n67. As of 2019, there are six UNESCO World\nHeritage Sites in the Philippines. Which of the\nfollowing is the last addition to the list?\nA. Baroque Churches of the Philippines\nB. Tubbataha Reefs Natural Park\n\nC. Puerto Princesa Subterranean River National\nPark\nD. Mount Hamiguitan Range Wildlife\nSanctuary💕\n\n71. Which country has unveiled its first Artificial\nIntelligence (A1) Police officer Ella that stands\nfor \"Electronic Lifelike Assistant\"?\nA. Australia\nB. New Zealand💕\n\n68. Prince Abdul Mateen Bolkiah of Brunei was\none of the popular athletes who competed in\nthe 30th Southeast Asian Games 2019, in what\nsports?\n\nC. Singapore\n\nA. Swimming\n\n72. The US space agency NASA has partnered\nwith SpaceX, Blue Origin and Dynetics to build\nlunar landing systems that can carry astronauts\nto the moon by 2024. Who is the owner of Blue\nOrigin company?\n\nB. Golf\nC. Polo💕\nD. Archery\n\nD. Russia\n\nA. Bill Gates\n69. Since 2019, more than a million people in\nHong Kong marched against a controversial\nbill that they fear will erode freedom in semiautonomous territory.\n\nB. Jeffrey Preston Bezos💕\nC. Larry Page\nD. Elon Reeve Musk\n\nA. People's Armed Police Bill\nB. Protection of Women's Rights and Interests\nBill\nC. Human Rights and Democracy Act\nD. Extradition Bill💕\n\n73. Which global association has asked the\nsocial media platforms to provide monthly\nreport on their actions to combat fake news?\nA. United Nations\nB. European Union💕\nC. WHO\n\n70. Which of the following city will host the 2022\nAsian Games?\n\nD. BRICS\n\nA. Hangzhou, China💕\nB. Doha, Qatar\nC. Abu Dhabi, UAE\nD. Busan, South Korea\n\n74. What is the new deadline for qualification\nperiod of Tokyo Olympics?\nA. June 4, 2021\nB. June 29, 2021💕\nC. July 4, 2021\nD. July 29, 2021\n\n75. According to the 32nd edition of World\nCompetitiveness Index 2020 which country is\non 1st position?\nA. USA\nB. China\nC. Singapore💕\nD. Russia\n\n76. The following are the satellites launched by\nthe Philippines EXCEPT\nA. Agila-1\nB. Maya-1\nC. Diwata-1\nD. Tamaraw-1💕\n\n77. Who became the first woman to reach the\nChallenger Deep, the deepest point in the\nocean located in the Mariana Trench?\nA. Hally Anderson\nB. Genna Madrid\nC. Michelle Smithson\nD. Kathy Sullivan💕\n\n78. Which is the host city for the 2020 Palarong\nPambansa?\nA. Dagupan City\nB. Cebu City\nC. Marikina City💕\nD. Puerto Princesa City\n\n79. What was the theme of 2020 International\nDay of UN Peacekeepers?\nA. Men in Peacekeeping - A path to Peace\nB. Women in Peacekeeping - A path to Peace\nC. Men in Peacekeeping - A key to Peace\nD. Women in Peacekeeping - A key to\nPeace💕\n\n80. What is the colour of 2020?\nA. Magenta\nB. Sunset\nC. Classic blue💕\nD. Creamy white",
