    "source_path": "/Users/lyndon/All reviewers/-LET REVIEWER 2026/C. MAJOR SUBJECTS/F. SOCIAL SCIENCE - SOCIAL STUDIES/Essential Reviewers/20. SOCIAL SCIENCE REVIEWER N.pdf",
