    "body": "Source: 23. THE PHILIPPINE CONSTITUTION PART 1.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nA. Relatives Up to The Third Degree of Consanguinity\nB. Children Including Those in Previous Marriages\nC. Unmarried Children Under 18 Years\nD. Children, Grandchildren and other descendants\n28. Section 8 of the state policies states that the Philippines, consistent with the national\ninterest, adopts and pursues a policy of freedom from what type of weapons in its\nterritory?\nA. Weapons of Mass Destruction\nB. Nuclear Weapons\nC. Biological Weapons\nD. Chemical Weapons\n29. The state shall protect and advance the right of the people to a balanced and healthful\n_________ in accord with the rhythm and Harmony of nature.\nA. Ecology\nB. Living\nC. Upbringing\nD. Society\n30. Republic act 6713 establishes a code of conduct and ethical standards for public\nofficials and employees. Which of the Following is not included in this act and its title?\nA. Providing rehabilitation of unjust actions and infringements\nB. Enumerating prohibited acts and transactions\nC. Providing penalties for violations\nD. Granting incentives and rewards for exemplary service\n\nAnswer Key:\n1) B\n2) C\n3) A\n4) B\n5) B\n6) D\n7) A\n8) C\n9) A\n10) B\n11) B\n12) A\n13) C\n14) C\n15) B\n16) C\n17) C\n18) A\n19) B\n20) B\n21) A\n22) A\n23) B\n24) B\n25) D\n26) B\n27) C\n28) C\n29) B\n30) A",
