    "body": "Source: 24. THE PHILIPPINE CONSTITUTION PART 2.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nb. Supreme court of the Philippines\nc. The electorate composed of qualified voters\nd. Upper house of the senate\n28. The constitution provides what special election exercise for qualified Filipinos abroad?\na. Absentee voting\nb. Waiving the residency rule\nc. Candidacy for offices below the senatorial level\nd. On-line registration\n29. Which of the following is among the official languages of the philippines?\na. English\nb. Arabic\nc. Tagalog\nd. Spanish\n30. The last part of section 4 a states that public officials and employees should practice\nwhich of the following:\na. Simple Living\nb. Simple Taste\nc. Simile Wealth\nd. Simple Thinking\n\nANSWER KEY:\n1. C\n2. B\n3. C\n4. C\n5. A\n6. C\n7. A\n8. A\n9. B\n10. D\n11. D\n12. B\n13. B\n14. A\n15. A\n16. D\n17. C\n18. A\n19. A\n20. B\n21. C\n22. A\n23. B\n24. A\n25. A\n26. A\n27. A\n28. A\n29. A\n30. A",
