    "body": "Source: A. Philippine Government Directory of Agencies and Officials.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nRepublic of the Philippines\n\nPhilippine Government\nDirectory of Agencies\nand Officials\n\nEXECUTIVE\nBRANCH\n\nEXECUTIVE\nBRANCH\n\nEXECUTIVE BRANCH\nThe Executive Branch implements national policies and performs the executive\nand administrative functions of the National Government. The Constitution\nvests the executive power in the President of the Philippines. The President is\nassisted by the Vice President and the Members of the Cabinet in the discharge\nof executive functions. Also part of the Executive Branch are State Universities\nand Colleges and Government-Owned and/or -Controlled Corporations.\n\nOFFICE OF THE PRESIDENT\nMalacañang Palace Compound, New Executive Bldg.\nJ. P. Laurel St., San Miguel, 1005 Manila\nTrunkline: (632) 8249-8310\nwww.op-proper.gov.ph\n\nH.E. FERDINAND R. MARCOS JR.\nPresident\n\nOffice of the Executive Secretary\nLUCAS P. BERSAMIN\nExecutive Secretary\n\nloc. 8410\n\nHUBERT DOMINIC B. GUEVARA\nSenior Deputy Executive Secretary\n\nloc. 8410\n\nLOLIBETH RAMIT-MEDRANO\nUndersecretary\n\nloc. 8410\n\nBRANDON C. DOMINGO\nAssistant Secretary\n\nloc. 8410\n\nSHARWINA W. GONZALES-LAFUENTE\nAssistant Secretary\n\nloc. 8410\n\nANGIEREEN D. MEDINA\nAssistant Secretary\n\nloc. 8410\nOffice of the Special Assistant to the President\n\nANTONIO ERNESTO F. LAGDAMEO JR.\nSpecial Assistant to the President\n\nloc. 8443\n\nJOAHNA PAULA Q. DOMINGO\nUndersecretary\n\nloc. 8443\n\nATHALIA B. LIONG\nUndersecretary\n\nloc. 8443\n\nRIA DANIELLE A. LUMAPAS\nAssistant Secretary\n\nloc. 8443\n\nALNESSA THEA R. UY\nAssistant Secretary\n\nloc. 8443\nOffice of the Chief Presidential Legal Counsel\n\nJUAN F. PONCE ENRILE\nChief Presidential Legal Counsel\n\nloc. 8458\n\nJOSEPH B. SAGANDOY JR.\nDeputy Presidential Legal Counsel\n\nloc. 8458\n\nMARFORTH T. FUA\nAssistant Presidential Legal Counsel\n\nloc. 8458\n\nROGEL C. GATCHALIAN\nAssistant President