    "body": "Source: A. Philippine Government Directory of Agencies and Officials.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nCommittee Affairs\nloc. 7113, 7114; 8931-2842; 8931-5764 F\narlene.dada-arnaldo@house.gov.ph\n\nROMULO EMMANUEL M. MIRAL JR.\nDeputy Secretary General\n\nCongressional Policy and Budget Research\nloc. 7503, 7594; 8931-6032; 8951-1754\nromuloemmanuel.jr.miral@house.gov.ph\n\nFLORO A. BANAYBANAY\nDeputy Secretary General\n\nEngineering and Physical Facilities\nloc. 7456, 7458; 8931-6611; 8931-5860 F\nfloro.banaybanay@house.gov.ph\n\nDANTE ROBERTO P. MALING\nDeputy Secretary General\n\nFinance\nloc. 7516; 8951-3943; 8952-0745 TF\ndanteroberto.maling@house.gov.ph\n\nJOSE MA. ANTONIO B. TUAÑO\nDeputy Secretary General\n\nInternal Audit\nloc. 7617; 8931-5204; 8931-5250 TF\njosemaantonio.tuaño@house.gov.ph\n\nGRACE N. ANDRES\nDeputy Secretary General\n\nInter-Parliamentary and Public Affairs\nloc. 8661\nipad@house.gov.ph\n\nANNALOU S. NACHURA\nDeputy Secretary General\n\nLegal Affairs\nloc. 7525; 8931-6124 TF\nannalou.nachura@house.gov.ph\n\nEDGARDO H. PANGILINAN\nDeputy Secretary General\n\nLegislative Information Resources Management\nloc. 7656, 7723; 8951-4322\nedgardo.pangilinan@house.gov.ph\n\nDAVID ROBERT U. AMORIN\nDeputy Secretary General\n\nLegislative Operations\nloc. 7526, 7677; 8931-5217; 8931-5728\ndavidrobert.amorin@house.gov.ph\n\nPMGEN. NAPOLEON C. TAAS\nSergeant-at-Arms\n\nloc. 7511, 7537; 8931-5808; 8931-6137\nnapoleon.taas@house.gov.ph\n\n153\n\n154\n\nJUDICIAL\nBRANCH\nJUDICIAL\nBRANCH\n\nJUDICIAL BRANCH\nThe Constitution vests judicial power in the Supreme Court and in such lower\ncourts as may be established by law.\nAt present, these lower courts are the Court of Appeals, Trial Courts\n(Regional, Metropolitan, Municipal and Municipal Circuit Trial Courts),\nSpecial Courts (Sandiganbayan and Court of Tax Appeals), and Shari’a\nCourts (Shari’a District and Circuit Courts). The Supreme Court exercises\nadministrative supervision over all courts and their personnel.\nAs provided for by the Constitution, judicial power includes the duty of the\ncourts of justice to settle actual controversies involving legally demandable\nand enforceable rights, and to determine whether or not there has been a\ngrave abuse of discretion amounting to lack or excess of jurisdiction on the\npart of any branch or instrumentality of the Government.\n\nSUPREME COURT OF THE PHILIPPINES\nPadre Faura Street cor. Taft Avenue\nErmita, 1000 Manila\n(632) 8552-9644; 8552-9646\nwww.sc.judiciary.gov.ph\n\nALEXANDER G. GESMUNDO\nChief Justice\n8523-4179\n\nASSOCIATE JUSTICES:\nMARVIC MARIO VICTOR F. LEONEN\n\n8522-5092\n\nALFREDO BENJAMIN S. CAGUIOA 8523-4187\nRAMON PAUL L. HERNANDO 8523-4177\nAMY C. LAZARO-JAVIER 8536-1048\nHENRI JEAN PAUL B. INTING 8526-6407\nRODIL V. ZALAMEDA 8526-6191\nMARIO V. LOPEZ 8523-7410\nSAMUEL H. GAERLAN 8523-2687\nRICARDO R. ROSARIO 8525-6844\nJHOSEP Y. LOPEZ 8524-1241 loc. 327\nJAPAR B. DIMAAMPAO 8526-7504\nJOSE MIDAS P. MARQUEZ 8524-7143\nANTONIO T. KHO, JR. 8526-6193\nMARIA FILOMENA D. SINGH 8523-4974\n\n157\n\nCOURT OF APPEALS\nMa. Orosa St., Ermita, 1000 Manila\nTrunkline: (632) 8524-1241 to 52\nwww.ca.judiciary.gov.ph\n\nREMEDIOS A. SALAZAR-FERNANDO\nPresiding Justice\n8525-7979; 8524-1241\ncoc.ca@judiciaru.gov.ph\n\nASSOCIATE JUSTICES (Manila):\nLOUIS P. ACOSTA\n\n158\n\n8524-1241\n\nSELMA P. ALARAS\n\n8524-1241\n\nEMILY R. ALIÑO-GELUZ\n\n8524-1241\n\nALFREDO D. AMPUAN\n\n8524-1241\n\nNINA G. ANTONIO-VALENZUELA\n\n8524-1241\n\nPERPETUA SUSANA T. ATAL-PAÑO\n\n8524-1241\n\nMARIE CHRISTINE AZCARRAGA JACOB\n\n8524-1241\n\nMANUEL M. BARRIOS\n\n8524-1241\n\nRAMON M. BATO JR.\n\n8524-1241\n\nLORENZA R. BORDIOS\n\n8524-1241\n\nAPOLINARIO D. BRUSELAS JR.\n\n8524-1241\n\nCARLITO B. CALPATURA\n\n8524-1241\n\nJAIME FORTUNATO A. CARINGAL\n\n8524-1241\n\nPEDRO B. CORALES\n\n8524-1241\n\nRAMON A. CRUZ\n\n8524-1241\n\nMAXIMO M. DE LEON\n\n8524-1241\n\nJOSE LORENZO R. DELA ROSA\n\n8524-1241\n\nGERALDINE C. FIEL-MACARAIG\n\n