    "body": "Source: B. CURRENT EVENTS - 2025 IN THE PHILIPPINES.pdf\nSource type: pdf\n\nApril\nApril 19 - Alexie Brooks wins Miss Eco International 2025 in Egypt.[228]\nApril 28 - Kirk Bondad is crowned Mister Pilipinas International 2025 in the pageant's\ncoronation night held at the Newport Performing Arts Theatre in Pasay.[229]\n\nTriple K LET Review Solutions\n\nApril 30 - The Fernando Poe Jr. Film Collection is included in the UNESCO list for the\nMemory of the World Programme.[230]\n\nMay\nMay 2 - Ahtisa Manalo of Quezon is crowned Miss Universe Philippines 2025 at the\npageant's coronation night at the Mall of Asia Arena in Pasay.[231]\nMay 12 - Francine Tajanlangit wins Miss Elite Global 2025 in India.[232]\nMay 23:\nKrishan Pauline Alerre wins Miss Aura International 2025 in Turkey.[233]\nPatricia Anne Nichole Bangug wins Miss Orient Tourism Global 2025 in Malaysia.[233]\nMay 31 - Krishnah Gravidez finishes in the Top 8 at Miss World 2025 in India.[234]\n\nJune\nJune 3 - CJ Opiaza is formally crowned Miss Grand International 2024 following the\nresignation of India's Rachel Gupta.[235]\nJune 10 - A court in Manila acquits drag artist Pura Luka Vega on charges of offending\nmoral and religious sensibilities over a rendition of the Lord's Prayer in 2023, citing failure to\nestablish reasonable guilt.[236]\nJune 15 - Katrina Anne Johnson of Davao del Norte is crowned Binibining Pilipinas 2025 in\nthe pageant's coronation night held at the Araneta Coliseum in Quezon City, while Annabelle\nMae McDonnell of Iligan is crowned Binibining Pilipinas Globe.[237]\nJune 18 - President Marcos signs into law Republic Act No. 12224 designating February 1\nas the National Day of Awareness on Hijab and other Traditional Garments and Attire.[238]\nJune 28:\nTarah Valencia finishes third runner-up at Miss Supranational 2025 in Poland.[239]\nKenneth Vincent Cabungcal finishes fourth runner-up at Mister Supranational 2025 in\nPoland.[240]\n\nJuly\nJuly 9 - Anne Patricia Lorenzo is crowned Miss International Queen Philippines 2025 in the\npageant's coronation night held at the SM Mall of Asia Arena in Pasay.[241]\nJuly 21 - Claw King, a claw machine in Cebu City measuring 49.90 cubic meters (1,761\ncubic feet), is recognized by the Guinness World Record as the world’s largest claw\nmachine.[242]\n\nAugust\nAugust 9 - Meridith Bobadilla finishes second runner-up at Miss Teen Earth 2025 in\nIndia.[243]\nAugust 10:\nJoy Barcoma of Bacoor, Cavite is crowned Miss Earth Philippines 2025 at the pageant's\ncoronation night held at the Okada Manila in Parañaque.[244]\nTriple K LET Review Solutions\n\nJasmine Omay finishes in the Top 13 at Universal Woman 2025 in India.[245]\nAugust 12 - Mindspark, the country's largest science museum, opens at Ayala Malls Manila\nBay in Parañaque.[246]\nAugust 24 - Emma Tiglao of Pampanga is crowned Miss Grand Philippines 2025 at the\npageant's coronation night held at the SM Mall of Asia Arena in Pasay.[247]\nAugust 29 - The Philippines wins the Guinness World Record for the largest number of\npeople planting coconut seedlings simultaneously across multiple locations, with\napproximately 10,000 coconut seedlings planted across 11 barangays in San Pablo,\nLaguna.[248]\nAugust 31 - Anna Margaret Mercado finishes in the Top 16 at Miss Teen International 2025\nin India.[249]\n\nSeptember\nSeptember 25 - Kirk Bondad is crowned Mister International 2025 in Thailand.[250]\n\nOctober\nOctober 5 - Jether Palomo finishes at the Top 11 at Mister Global 2025 in Thailand.[251]\nOctober 8 - Anita Gomez finishes as first runner-up at Miss Asia Pacific International 2025\nat the Cebu Coliseum in Cebu City.[252]\nOctober 14 - Sugar Mercado is crowned Mrs Universe 2025 in Laguna.[253]\nOctober 15 - Annabelle Mae McDonnell finishes in the top 11 at Miss Globe 2025 in\nAlbania.[254]\nOctober 16 - The Philippines wins the Guinness World Record for the largest nut brittle\ncreated, with a 144.16 m2 (1,551.7 sq ft) product displayed at the Kasanggayahan Festival\nin Sorsogon City.[255]\nOctober 18:\nEmma Tiglao is crowned Miss Grand International 2025 in Thailand.[256]\nEds Enero is crowned Miss Tourism Queen of the Year International at Miss Tourism\nInternational 2025 in Malaysia.[257]\nOctober 30 - The Michelin Guide publishes its first restaurant listings in the Philippines and\nawards nine restaurants Michelin Stars.[258]\nOctober 31 - Dumaguete and Quezon City are designated as members of the Creative\nCities Network by UNESCO.[259]\n\nNovember\nNovember 5 - Joy Barcoma finishes as one of the four runners-up of Miss Earth 2025 at\nOkada Manila in Parañaque.[260]\nNovember 10 - The Sibugay Wetland Nature Reserve in Zamboanga Sibugay is designated\nas an East Asian-Australasian Flyway Partnership Flyway Network Site.[261]\nNovember 21:\nAhtisa Manalo finishes as third runner-up at Miss Universe 2025 in Thailand.[262]\n\nTriple K LET Review Solutions\n\nThe Balinsasayao Twin Lakes Natural Park in Negros Oriental is designated as an\nASEAN Heritage Park.[263]\nNovember 27 - Myrna Esguerra finishes as fourth runner-up at Miss International 2025 in\nJapan.[264]\nNovember 30:\nNikki Buenafe Cheveh is crowned Face of Beauty International 2025 in Taiwan.[265]\nThe Philippines wins the Guinness World Record for the most condoms donated in an\nhour, with 13,312 specimen used at a celebration of World AIDS Day organized by DKT\nInternational and Watsons at the University of the Philippines Diliman in Quezon\nCity.[266]\n\nDecember\nDecember 9 - Asín tibuok, an artisanal sea salt originating from Bohol, is recognized as\nIntangible Cultural Heritage in Need of Urgent Safeguarding by UNESCO.[267]\nDecember 12 -\nCyrille Payumo finishes in the Top 20 at Miss Charm 2025 in Vietnam.[268]\nThe Velarde map and the Philippine Declaration of Independence are officially declared\nas national cultural treasures by the National Library of the Philippines.[269]\nDecember 20 - Chelsea Fernandez finishes as first runner-up at Miss Cosmo 2025 in\nVietnam.[270]\n\nSports\nDeaths\n\nGloria\nRomero\n\nNora Aunor\n\nEdcel\nLagman\n\nHajji\nAlejandro\n\nMargarita\nForés\n\nJiggly\nCaliente\n\nEduardo\nNonato\nJoson\n\nRicky\nDavao\n\nDelia Razon\n\nAmay\nBisaya\n\nTriple K LET Review Solutions\n\nEstelito\nMendoza\n\nFreddie\nAguilar\n\nPilita\nCorrales\n\nLuis\nJalandoni\n\nReynaldo\nTamayo Sr.\n\nBruce\nMcTavish\n\nFelicito\nPayumo\n\nDavey\nLangit\n\nNicanor\nPerlas\n\nJuan Ponce\nEnrile\n\nMike de\nLeon\n\nReynante\nTolentino\n\nPangalian\nBalindong\n\nEduardo\nErmita\n\nRosa Rosal\n\nAlonzo\nSaclag\n\nBernardo P.\nPardo\n\nCathy\nCabral\n\nRomeo\nAcop",
