    "source_path": "/Users/lyndon/All reviewers/-LET REVIEWER 2026/C. MAJOR SUBJECTS/F. SOCIAL SCIENCE - SOCIAL STUDIES/MindGym Review Materials/3. MINDGYM_SOCIAL STUDIES-MAJOR FORMS OF GOVERNMENT_LECTURE NOTES.pdf",
